{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p063d","title":"魏氏春秋记司马昭为夏侯玄泣请司马师以赵俨葬众迎玄为怨","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p063d-account","label":"《魏氏春秋》","text":"魏氏春秋记司马昭为夏侯玄泣请司马师以赵俨葬众迎玄为怨","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p063d-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-a-p064-judgment","label":"裴松之按语","text":"裴松之以夏侯玄正始五年已出镇、十年才还洛及赵俨六年卒，反驳夏侯玄会葬致司马师恶的故事。","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p064-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"泣请","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p063d-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0038","role":"不释","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p063d-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0064","role":"被求免","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p063d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯霸奔蜀至夏侯玄被收","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p063d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p063d-q","source_order":[9,623,"P063d"],"order":2363}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0038","name":"司马师","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0064","name":"夏侯玄","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p063d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-a28301d33c65814e2e54","layer":"pei","quote":"玄之执也，（卫将军）〔安东将军〕司马文王流涕请之。大将军曰：‘卿忘会赵司空葬乎？’先是，司空赵俨薨，大将军兄弟会葬，宾客以百数；玄时后至，众宾客咸越席而迎，大将军由是恶之。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":622,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-31bf80f2d3548114eff9","start":133,"end":219,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p064-judgment","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e35b7b5fa3df2e8586d7","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：曹爽以正始五年伐蜀，时玄已为关中都督；至十年，爽诛灭后，方还洛耳。按《少帝纪》，司空赵俨以六年亡，玄则无由得会俨葬；若云玄入朝，纪、传又无其事：斯近妄，不实。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-31bf80f2d3548114eff9","start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
